            "detailed_description": "In Kingdom Defense you have to be in the role of the commander of the defense of the kingdom. You will have to keep defense using three towers, soldiers, traps and a variety of improvements for them. For a successful level you need to hold out under the pressure of hostile troops, not allowing him to get to the territory of the kingdom.<br />\r\nAt each level you have to build your own strategy defense and develop it as the onset of the enemy and accumulation of stocks to improve their defensive turn.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\nA variety of opponents<br />\r\nSeveral types of defensive structures<br />\r\n12 different levels",
